          "author": "Matthew Sweetapple, Steve Punt",
          "description": "The Spooo Who Grew is a mini-adventure featuring our favourite characters, a thought-provoking evolutionary tale with a new song. \n\nOn Infinity, the Cocklebur Ick is surprised to see the whole Island has turned out to celebrate someone’s birthday. But who’s birthday is it?! And who could be SO important that every single creature wants to share in the celebrations? The third story by the award-winning Rockford's Rock Opera. ",
